==English==

===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:level<ety:bor<fro:livel<ety:inh<la:libella>>>>|tree=+}}
From {{inh|en|enm|level}}, from {{der|en|fro|livel}}, {{m|fro|liveau|g=m}}, later {{m|fro|nivel}}, {{m|fro|niveau}}, from {{der|en|g=f|la|libella||a balance, a level}}, diminutive of {{m|la|libra|g=f||a balance, a level}}; see [[libra]], [[librate]]. {{doublet|en|libella|niveau}}.

The verb is from {{inh|en|enm|levelen}}, from the noun.

===Pronunciation===
